718	  // consumes a customer coupon. The CARD path does NOT claim here — it reserved the coupon
719	  // before checkout and CONFIRMS that hold inside the charge tx below (`cardCouponToken`),
720	  // which is what closes the concurrent-checkout bypass the read-then-swallow left open.
