743	      // ATOMIC first-month-free claim, INSIDE the charge tx (mirrors claimOrderCoupon).
744	      // Contend for the redemption BEFORE debiting so the debit amount matches the
745	      // outcome. A lost claim never throws — on the wallet path we add the credit
746	      // back and charge FULL; on the card path the money already settled at the sold
