149	 * Which products the first-month-free promo is granted on. Owner decision
150	 * (2026-08-11): **Shared Web Hosting ONLY**. A free month of a $2.99–$8.99
151	 * hosting plan is a cheap acquisition offer for the first paid ad channel;
152	 * a free month of a $6.49–$32.99 VPS (or a game/email plan) is real exposure.
153	 * VPS / EMAIL / GAME always bill full. To extend the promo to another product
154	 * later, add its PromoServiceType here — every order flow reads this one gate,
